     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>I am trying to create detection history. A &quot;Error&quot; appeared. Thank you.<br><br>Hist_panthera &lt;- detectionHistory(WorkbookR_Mil,camOp = WorkbookR_Mil, stationCol = &quot;Station&quot;, speciesCol = &quot;Speciesname&quot;, recordDateTimeCol = &quot;DateTimeOriginal&quot;, recordDateTimeFormat = &quot;%m-%d-%Y&quot;, species = &quot;Panthera onca&quot;,occasionLength = 1,day1 = &quot;station&quot;, includeEffort = FALSE)<br><br>Error: stationCol = &quot;Station&quot; is not a column name in recordTable<br><br>However, my table shows:<br><br>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:615pt\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"615\">\n\n <colgroup><col style=\"width:65pt\" width=\"65\" span=\"3\">\n <col style=\"width:124pt\" width=\"124\" span=\"2\">\n <col style=\"width:81pt\" width=\"81\">\n <col style=\"width:91pt\" width=\"91\">\n </colgroup><tbody><tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\n  <td style=\"height:15.0pt;width:65pt\" height=\"15\" width=\"65\">Station</td>\n  <td style=\"width:65pt\" width=\"65\">CameraID</td>\n  <td style=\"width:65pt\" width=\"65\">SdID</td>\n  <td style=\"width:124pt\" width=\"124\">Speciesname</td>\n  <td style=\"width:124pt\" width=\"124\">DateTimeOriginal</td>\n  <td style=\"width:81pt\" width=\"81\">CAPTUREDATE</td>\n  <td style=\"width:91pt\" width=\"91\">CAPTURETIME</td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\n  <td style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">C1</td>\n  <td>21</td>\n  <td>30</td>\n  <td>Unk-mammal</td>\n  <td>11/12/16 20:56</td>\n  <td>11/12/16</td>\n  <td>20:56</td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\n  <td style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">C1</td>\n  <td>21</td>\n  <td>98</td>\n  <td>Hum-bird</td>\n  <td>11/17/16 14:35</td>\n  <td>11/17/16</td>\n  <td>14:35</td>\n </tr>\n <tr style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">\n  <td style=\"height:15.0pt\" height=\"15\">C2</td>\n  <td>23</td>