     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div>there may be an issue with your function arguments. </div><div><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">detectionHistory(<b>WorkbookR_Mil</b>,camOp = <b>WorkbookR_Mil</b>, ...)</font><br></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">WorkbookR_Mil </span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">appears twice. This seems wrong. </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">First of all, it is good practice to explicitly name your arguments, as there is many of them. So write it as: </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">detectionHistory(<font color=\"#ff0000\"><b>recordTable </b></font>= </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">WorkbookR_Mil</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">, camOp = ...)</span><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\"><br></span></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Then, make sure your recordTable argument refers to the correct data frame. If you are not sure check or post the output of </font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">str(</font><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">WorkbookR_</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">Mil)  </span></div><div><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">colnames(</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">WorkbookR_</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;courier new&quot;,monospace\">Mil)</span></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\"><br></font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Cheers,</font></div><div><font face=\"arial, sans-serif\">Jürgen</font></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
